DOCUMENT();
loadMacros('PGstandard.pl', 'MathObjects.pl', 'PGcourse.pl');
TEXT(beginproblem());
$showPartialCorrectAnswers = 0;
$prompt = <<'PROMPT_E25D_6C98';
<p>e25d_6c98</p> <h4>Three-Point Test Cross Problem</h4><p>A test cross is a way to explore the relationship between genes and their respective alleles. It is a useful tool for genetic mapping and deciphering the inheritance of traits. Specifically, a three-point test cross examines three (3) genes at the same time to learn about their assortment in gamete formation.</p><p>A standard three-point test cross involves crossing a heterozygous organism for all three genes with an organism that is homozygous recessive for all three genes</p> <p>For this problem, a test cross using a fruit fly (<i>Drosophila melanogaster</i>) heterozygous for three genes was conducted to understand their genetic interactions.</p><h6>Characteristics of Recessive Phenotypes</h6><p><ul><li><strong><span style="color: #845011;">Gene K</span></strong> is related to the '<span style="color: #845011;"><i>kidney</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #845011;">Gene K</span> has a body shape that is curved, similar to a kidney bean.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #286d3f;">Gene P</span></strong> is connected with the '<span style="color: #286d3f;"><i>prickly</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #286d3f;">Gene P</span> is covered with sharp bristles, giving it a spiky texture.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #086594;">Gene T</span></strong> is connected with the '<span style="color: #086594;"><i>tipsy</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #086594;">Gene T</span> moves in an erratic path, suggesting a lack of coordination, as if intoxicated.</li> </ul></p><table style="border-collapse: collapse; border: 2px solid black;"><tr><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Phenotype</span></th><th colspan="3" align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Genotypes</span></th><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Progeny<br/>Count</span></th></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">kidney, prickly, tipsy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe5cf; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">k</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #d4f4d6; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">p</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #d9edff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">t</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">3,177</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">kidney, prickly</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe5cf; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">k</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #d4f4d6; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">p</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #086594;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">7,965</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">kidney, tipsy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe5cf; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">k</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #286d3f;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #d9edff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">t</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">725</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">kidney</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe5cf; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">k</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #286d3f;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #086594;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">13,074</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">prickly, tipsy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #845011;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #d4f4d6; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">p</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #d9edff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">t</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">12,995</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">prickly</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #845011;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #d4f4d6; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">p</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #086594;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">779</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">tipsy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #845011;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #286d3f;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #d9edff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">t</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">8,131</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;"><i>wildtype</i></span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #845011;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #286d3f;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #086594;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">3,154</span></td></tr><tr><th colspan="4" align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">TOTAL =</span></th><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">50,000</span></td></tr></table><p>The resulting phenotypes are summarized in the table above.</p> <h6>Question</h6> <p>With the progeny data from the table, and using only the genotypes that result from crossover events between the two genes <b>K</b> and <b>T</b> during meiosis.</p> <p><strong>calculate the genetic distance between the two genes <b>K</b> and <b>T</b>,</strong> expressing your answer in centimorgans (cM)</p>
PROMPT_E25D_6C98
loadMacros('parserRadioButtons.pl');
$choice_1 = <<'LITERAL_E25D_6C98_CHOICE_1';
<sup>(12,995 + 13,074)</sup>/<sub>50,000</sub> = <sup>26,069</sup>/<sub>50,000</sub> = 0.5214 = <strong>52.14 cM</strong>
LITERAL_E25D_6C98_CHOICE_1
$choice_2 = <<'LITERAL_E25D_6C98_CHOICE_2';
<sup>(725 + 3,154 + 7,965 + 8,131)</sup>/<sub>50,000</sub> = <sup>19,975</sup>/<sub>50,000</sub> = 0.3995 = <strong>39.95 cM</strong>
LITERAL_E25D_6C98_CHOICE_2
$choice_3 = <<'LITERAL_E25D_6C98_CHOICE_3';
<sup>(725 + 779 + 3,154 + 3,177)</sup>/<sub>50,000</sub> = <sup>7,835</sup>/<sub>50,000</sub> = 0.1567 = <strong>15.67 cM</strong>
LITERAL_E25D_6C98_CHOICE_3
$choice_4 = <<'LITERAL_E25D_6C98_CHOICE_4';
<sup>(725 + 779 + 3,154 + 7,965)</sup>/<sub>50,000</sub> = <sup>12,623</sup>/<sub>50,000</sub> = 0.2525 = <strong>25.25 cM</strong>
LITERAL_E25D_6C98_CHOICE_4
$choice_5 = <<'LITERAL_E25D_6C98_CHOICE_5';
<sup>(779 + 3,154 + 3,177 + 8,131)</sup>/<sub>50,000</sub> = <sup>15,241</sup>/<sub>50,000</sub> = 0.3048 = <strong>30.48 cM</strong>
LITERAL_E25D_6C98_CHOICE_5
$choice_6 = <<'LITERAL_E25D_6C98_CHOICE_6';
<sup>(779 + 3,177 + 8,131 + 13,074)</sup>/<sub>50,000</sub> = <sup>25,161</sup>/<sub>50,000</sub> = 0.5032 = <strong>50.32 cM</strong>
LITERAL_E25D_6C98_CHOICE_6
$correct_1 = <<'LITERAL_E25D_6C98_CORRECT_1';
<sup>(725 + 779 + 3,154 + 3,177)</sup>/<sub>50,000</sub> = <sup>7,835</sup>/<sub>50,000</sub> = 0.1567 = <strong>15.67 cM</strong>
LITERAL_E25D_6C98_CORRECT_1
@choices = ($choice_1, $choice_2, $choice_3, $choice_4, $choice_5, $choice_6);
$answer = RadioButtons([@choices], $correct_1, labels => 'ABC', displayLabels => 1, randomize => 0, noindex => 1, separator => '<div style="margin-bottom: 0.7em;"></div>');
TEXT(MODES(HTML => $prompt, TeX => ''));
BEGIN_TEXT
\{$answer->buttons\}
END_TEXT
ANS($answer->cmp);

ENDDOCUMENT();
